2026-06-01 15:08:56,647 | AGENT | SecurityCompliance Agent answered: To meet the client's requirements, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can leverage its existing GDPR compliance posture. Our standard data residency is EU only, and cross-border transfers are prohibited by default unless an explicit legal basis exists. We have a Data Protection Officer appointed, and their contact information is dpo@nexus-engineering.it. 

